{"id":878559,"title":"03︱智能体工作原理","content":"AI智能体和AI数字员工的工作原理模仿了人类与世界的交互方式，通过感官接收信息、大脑处理并规划行动、躯体执行任务三个步骤完成工作。首先，AI智能体通过文字、语音、图像等信号获取信息，类似于人类的五官感知世界。其次，这些信息被传递给类似DeepSeek V3或千问这样的大模型作为“大脑”，进行分析判断，并制定行动计划。例如，当接收到“看看天空，你觉得明天会下雨吗？如果是这样，把雨伞给我”的指令时，AI智能体会查询天气预报，根据结果决定是否需要进一步行动。最后，AI智能体将计划转化为具体操作，如发送提醒信息或调度机械臂取伞。整个过程展示了AI智能体如何集成外部API和服务，以实现复杂任务自动化，提高工作效率。这解释了为何各大科技公司都在积极布局AI智能体平台。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":400550,"user_name":"实数","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2637725,"ip_address":"上海","ucode":"697BEAFCE929D2","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/28/3f/9d/c59c12ad.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1748309883,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":2,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101048201,"comment_content":"老师 资料有发的吗","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":2036110,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1f/11/8e/0f6c4064.jpg","nickname":"-Senny","note":"","ucode":"269202444B3481","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":668910,"discussion_content":"为啥没资料呢，我也想要","content_length":11,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1753407756,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"浙江","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]},{"author":{"id":1769171,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1a/fe/d3/d9c1b183.jpg","nickname":"极简架构","note":"","ucode":"B31C9E0921F64A","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":661555,"discussion_content":"同要课件ppt","content_length":7,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1748360149,"is_liked":false